Swarm Drive
===========

An arcade shooter for the BMW iDrive 7 (MGU) head unit. MIT licence (LICENSE).
The game, its pixel art, its font and its name are original to this project.

This repository contains, in kit/, a copy of part of

    idrive7-apps, https://github.com/cauliflowermossgrape/idrive7-apps
    Copyright (c) 2026 cauliflowermossgrape
    Copyright (c) 2026 小白151 (GitHub: JackieZ123430), Chinese translation
    MIT licence (kit/LICENSE)

at the commit named in kit/UPSTREAM.json, unchanged: the build script, the app
runtime it packs into the app, and the permissions template. The fonts in
kit/runtime/fonts are under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 (the OFL-*.txt files
beside them).

patches/idrive7-apps holds changes to that project's emulator, applied to the
submodule vendor/idrive7-apps on a developer's PC only (tools/setup.js).

The kit's GPU renderer (mgu-render, GPL-3.0-or-later) and the emulator's build
of its draw engine are not part of this repository's own files. They are in the
submodule vendor/idrive7-apps, under their own licences, and run as their own
programs.

BMW's app SDK is not in this repository. This project is not affiliated with or
endorsed by BMW AG. BMW and iDrive are trademarks of BMW AG.
